  ;; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ;; Native Sandscript Proof.Term surface
  ;;
  ;; The interpreter resolves the pointer-free Proof namespace without a
  ;; host-injected prelude. Proof terms are kernel-minted OBJ_THEOREM handles
