  ;; Closed reflexivity uses kernel conversion, not structural hole unification.
  


  ;; Reserve checker workspace after the canonical artifact bytes. Preserve the
  ;; ArrayBuffer's physical byteLength for large-object GC sizing; the artifact
  ;; header carries its logical length, and artifact export copies only that prefix.
